==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Palafin}}'s {{fd|Palafin|Hero Form}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Palafin|62}} from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Jet Punch}} attack; this is Palafin's [[signature move]] in the [[Pokémon games]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

